    field as material gains the following effect.\r\n\u25CF Once per turn, during
    the turn this card was Special Summoned, when your opponent activates a card
    or effect (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect.\r\nYou can only use each
    effect of \"Mathmech Diameter\" once per turn."
